# ── CWOS (managed block — ADR-058) ──────────────────────────────────────
# Workstream state JSON is a per-node rebuildable cache: it is rewritten
# wholesale on every event and cannot merge across machines. It rebuilds
# automatically from your queue/findings/sprints/programs files, so it
# never needs to be in version control. findings-feedback-manifest.json
# is calibration data, not cache — it stays tracked.
.claude/workstream/state/*.json
!.claude/workstream/state/findings-feedback-manifest.json
.claude/workstream/state/*.lock
# The event log is machine-local by design (ADR-057/ADR-058).
.claude/workstream/events/
.claude/workstream/telemetry/
.claude/workstream/tmp/
.claude/.tmp-*.json
.cwos-snapshots/

# CWOS - added by kit upgrade
.claude/workstream/dispatch-spool.jsonl
.claude/workstream/dispatch-spool.jsonl.*
.claude/workstream/liveness/
.claude/workstream/state/test-sweeps/
.claude/workstream/.hooks-liveness.yaml
.claude/workstream/.verify-liveness.yaml
.claude/workstream/.test-sweep.json
.claude/workstream/.session-recovery.mutex
.claude/workstream/.current-session
.claude/workstream/meta/invariant-firing-log.yaml
.claude/workstream/**/*.lock
.claude/workstream/**/*.tmp
.cwos-worktree.json
**/.claude/worktrees/
.claude/workstream/.active-sessions/
